Hi David,

Off-list because my reply to this particular comment is perhaps  
offensive:

> I don't know what LaTeX3 will be comprised of, so there is not much I
> can comment on.

Isn't it a major problem that a member of the LaTeX3 team would say  
something like this?! Hell, (pardon my language) what are the members  
of the LaTeX3 team doing if it's not working on LaTeX3?

Okay, not everyone is working on LaTeX3, obviously. That's cool. But  
I'm really curious what everyone's up to.

